Q44. Decision Tree — Entropy manually

Formula from your manual:

Entropy(S) = - Σ pᵢ log₂(pᵢ)

Python skeleton:

import math

def entropy(probabilities):

    result = 0

    for p in probabilities:

        if p > 0:
            result -= p * math.log2(p)

    return result

Example:

# 🔴 CHANGE probabilities
